WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.490
- Now, you're tiny and
weak and I'm the opposite.

00:00:03.490 --> 00:00:07.800
So, the objective of this
exercise is to get past me.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.140
Now, a good idea might be
to cause a distraction.

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:12.997
Because otherwise, there'd
zero chance of you--

00:00:14.395 --> 00:00:16.543
Blueberry!

00:00:18.159 --> 00:00:18.992
Blueberry.

00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:29.057
- That's some cold blooded (beep).

00:00:29.057 --> 00:00:30.689
(laughing)

00:00:30.689 --> 00:00:33.338
- That was Dave Bautista and Chloe Coleman

00:00:33.338 --> 00:00:35.260
in their new movie, "My Spy".

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:38.950
So Chloe, someone told me that Dave got

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:40.890
a little too intense on set.

00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:43.820
That you know, there might
have been a swear jar.

00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:47.640
- Oh, you know, actually he
was swearing earlier backstage

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:48.473
and I have--

00:00:48.473 --> 00:00:49.407
- I gave you 20 bucks backstage.

00:00:49.407 --> 00:00:52.010
- Yeah, I have 20 bucks right here.

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:54.352
He gave me 20 bucks
because he was swearing.

00:00:54.352 --> 00:00:56.090
- Oh my gosh.

00:00:56.090 --> 00:00:59.310
How much Dave, do you
think that you contributed

00:00:59.310 --> 00:01:01.006
to that jar?

00:01:01.006 --> 00:01:02.850
(laughing)

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:04.890
- It got to the point
where I was just like,

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:06.210
I was paying her so much even on credit--

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:07.048
- Before you opened your mouth.

00:01:07.048 --> 00:01:07.881
- Yeah.

00:01:08.810 --> 00:01:10.180
- I don't know, maybe half of it.

00:01:10.180 --> 00:01:11.013
Maybe half.
- Yeah.

00:01:11.013 --> 00:01:12.323
- Maybe not, 100 bucks or so.

00:01:13.345 --> 00:01:14.178
- 100 bucks?

00:01:14.178 --> 00:01:15.011
You get it girl.

00:01:15.011 --> 00:01:16.780
- It was like $2 a cuss word then.

00:01:16.780 --> 00:01:17.680
Now it's like five bucks a--

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:18.620
- Yeah, five bucks a cuss word.

00:01:18.620 --> 00:01:21.220
- See, I tell my kids,
you can curse like mommy,

00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:23.621
when you pay your bills like mommy.

00:01:23.621 --> 00:01:25.600
So yeah, you can say whatever you like

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:26.433
as soon as you start paying.

00:01:26.433 --> 00:01:27.550
- And we were actually, yeah we were all,

00:01:27.550 --> 00:01:29.210
I mean we're okay with it because we knew,

00:01:29.210 --> 00:01:31.510
we were all aware that
there was children on set

00:01:31.510 --> 00:01:32.730
we needed to be better by.

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:34.850
It was just something that I
guess once you're in a rhythm

00:01:34.850 --> 00:01:36.780
of speaking a certain
way throughout your life.

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:37.613
- Yeah, yeah.

00:01:37.613 --> 00:01:38.980
- It's hard to contain and control.

00:01:38.980 --> 00:01:40.330
- Hard to keep it classy.

00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:41.464
- It is.

00:01:41.464 --> 00:01:42.480
- [Chloe] I can understand.

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:44.280
- We made an effort.

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:45.113
- That's amazing.

00:01:45.113 --> 00:01:46.520
- She donated all the money.

00:01:46.520 --> 00:01:47.353
- Oh, you did?

00:01:47.353 --> 00:01:49.220
- I donated it to the Amazon Rainforest

00:01:49.220 --> 00:01:51.000
because you know when it set on fire

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:52.334
it was like yeah.

00:01:52.334 --> 00:01:53.426
(audience clapping)

00:01:53.426 --> 00:01:54.560
- That's amazing.

00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:55.531
- Thank you.

00:01:55.531 --> 00:01:58.840
We raised $256.

00:01:58.840 --> 00:02:01.197
That's how many people
were swearing on set.

00:02:01.197 --> 00:02:02.030
(laughing)

00:02:02.030 --> 00:02:05.567
I was just, I was like are
they really gonna be this mad

00:02:05.567 --> 00:02:07.530
about it, like how hard is it?

00:02:07.530 --> 00:02:09.155
- It is so hard.

00:02:09.155 --> 00:02:10.692
(laughing)

